====Behavior====
Yinglong starts the phase with 3 {{StatusEffect|Flower-burying Pin -埋花針- (Yinglong)|b}} and 20 {{StatusEffect|Scaleclad|b}}. It uses the following skill rotation:
*Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Levinflash [閃雷], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], The Descending Pin [落針], Draconic Vortex [龍卷], Draconic Vortex [龍卷]
*Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], The Descending Pin [落針], Draconic Vortex [龍卷], Gathering Rain [積雨]
*Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Levinflash [閃雷], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], The Descending Pin [落針], Draconic Vortex [龍卷], Draconic Vortex [龍卷]
*Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], The Descending Pin [落針], Gathering Rain [積雨], Gathering Rain [積雨]

If the Inverted Scale part was hit in the previous turn, the skill slot using 'Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍]' will be absent.

For every [[Flower-burying Pin]] on the field, one instance of 'The Descending Pin [落針]' will be replaced by 'Levinfall [落雷]', targeting the respective Flower-Burying Pin.

The turn will end and the battle will move to the next phase when Yinglong's Shield HP is depleted.

