====Behavior====
Yinglong starts the phase with 3 {{StatusEffect|Flower-burying Pin -埋花針- (Yinglong)|b}}, 1 {{StatusEffect|Flower-burying Wedge -埋花櫼- (Yinglong)|r}}, and 30% HP on all parts except for the Flower-burying Wedge. Yinglong cannot be defeated until the Flower-burying Wedge part is broken.

Yinglong uses the following skill rotation:
*The Dragon's Wedge [龍之櫼], Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Levinflash [閃雷], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], Draconic Vortex [龍卷], Gathering Rain [積雨]
*The Dragon's Wedge [龍之櫼], Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍], Levinflash [閃雷], Roar of the Dragon [龍聲], The Descending Pin [落針], Draconic Vortex [龍卷], Gathering Rain [積雨]
*Tides Born of Dragon's Tears [龍淚成濤]

If the Inverted Scale part was hit in the previous turn, the skill slot using 'Wrath of the Inverted Scale [逆鱗之禍]' will be absent.

If a [[Flower-burying Pin]] is on the field, 'The Descending Pin [落針]' will be replaced by 'Levinfall [落雷]', targeting the respective Flower-Burying Pin.

If one of Yinglong's parts is currently broken, any skill slots using the part's respective skills will be absent from the rotation.

